## manifest
pack.credits=Dragon Universe v1.7.1 - based on Dragon Evolution by About04
pack.description=Awaken your inner power, overcome incredible challenges, and face fearsome enemies from the Dragon Ball universe.
pack.name=Dragon Universe
pack.news=§uHello, Dragon Universe fans! In the latest updates, our main focus has been optimizing the add-on to provide better performance on both servers and a wider range of devices. We've made numerous improvements and refactors, which is why we're releasing this beta version for testing. Please keep in mind that development is still ongoing. Some content is still being completed, and a few hairstyles have been temporarily replaced until their final versions are ready. Thank you to everyone who tests the update and shares feedback!§r





