## npcs
ui.dbe.npc=Dialogue
ui.dbe.npcIgnored.1=§eThey don't seem willing to talk right now.
ui.dbe.npcIgnored.2=§eIt looks like this character prefers to stay silent.
ui.dbe.npcIgnored.3=§eYou get no response.
ui.dbe.npcIgnored.4=§eThis doesn't seem like a good time to talk to them.
ui.dbe.npcIgnored.5=§eThey glance at you... then look away.
ui.dbe.npcIgnored.6=§eNo answer. Maybe try again later.
## akira toriyama
ui.dbe.npc.akira_toriyama.title=Akira Toriyama
ui.dbe.npc.akira_toriyama.main.text.neutral=Everyone, be well, just like Goku and his friends. I'll be okay too!
ui.dbe.npc.akira_toriyama.main.text.good=Nice to see heroes around here! Keep protecting the world, just like Goku would.
ui.dbe.npc.akira_toriyama.main.text.evil=Hehe... You villains also help the story move forward. Just don't make me redraw everything!
## babidi
ui.dbe.npc.babidi.title=Babidi
ui.dbe.npc.babidi.main.text.neutral=You hesitate between light and darkness. I do not waste my time on the indecisive.
ui.dbe.npc.babidi.main.text.good=Such an irritating energy... Heroes make me sick. Leave before I lose my patience.
ui.dbe.npc.babidi.main.text.evil=Hehehe! Excellent! Your heart has already been consumed by darkness. Come, let me reveal the true power that lies within you.
ui.dbe.npc.babidi.main.button.skills=Skills
## beerus
ui.dbe.npc.beerus.title=Beerus
ui.dbe.npc.beerus.main.text.neutral=You dare disturb a God of Destruction? Hmph... This better be worth my time. Show me what you've got.
ui.dbe.npc.beerus.main.text.good=Hmph... Heroes or not, you're less boring than nothing. Let's see if you're worth something.
ui.dbe.npc.beerus.main.text.evil=Now we're talking! A bit of chaos to spice up my day. Show me you're worth the trouble!
ui.dbe.npc.beerus.main.button.skills=Skills
## bulma
ui.dbe.npc.bulma.title=Bulma
ui.dbe.npc.bulma.main.text.neutral=Hi! I'm Bulma. I'm not much of a fighter, but my intelligence has saved the world several times. Do you need something?
ui.dbe.npc.bulma.main.text.good=You seem trustworthy! I like helping people who use their brains before their fists. Maybe I have something useful for you.
ui.dbe.npc.bulma.main.text.evil=Hey, stay away from me with that attitude! I won't help someone who only wants to cause trouble.
ui.dbe.npc.bulma.main.button.shop=Inventions
## cell 
ui.dbe.npc.cell.title=Cell
ui.dbe.npc.cell.main.text.neutral=Hehehe... I see you've come to me. Are you truly worthy of becoming part of my perfection?
ui.dbe.npc.cell.main.text.good=A pure heart, yet so weak... What a waste of energy. Perhaps I'll absorb you to increase my power!
ui.dbe.npc.cell.main.text.evil=Ahhh, yes! I can feel the darkness within you. Together, we could spread perfect chaos across this world!
ui.dbe.npc.cell.main.button.skills=Skills
## chi chi
ui.dbe.npc.chi_chi.title=Chi-Chi
ui.dbe.npc.chi_chi.main.text.neutral=HAVE YOU SEEN GOKU?! That man is always disappearing at the worst possible time! If you haven't seen him, say it already and stop wasting my time!
ui.dbe.npc.chi_chi.main.text.good=Hmph… at least you seem polite. If you see Goku around, TELL HIM TO COME HOME! In the meantime… I can sell you some food. It's not free, got it?!
ui.dbe.npc.chi_chi.main.text.evil=WHAT?! With that kind of troublemaker attitude, you're just like Goku! I'm not selling you ANYTHING! Now get out of my sight!
ui.dbe.npc.chi_chi.main.button.shop=Buy Food
## enma daioh
ui.dbe.npc.enma_daioh.title=King Enma
ui.dbe.npc.enma_daioh.main.text.neutral=Welcome to the Other World! Unfortunately, you've died, and your fate is uncertain.
ui.dbe.npc.enma_daioh.main.text.good=You died... but you were a good soul. Perhaps there's a special place for you on the other side.
ui.dbe.npc.enma_daioh.main.text.evil=You finally showed up! Your record is long... Hahaha! You'll have a hard time getting out of this one.
ui.dbe.npc.enma_daioh.main.button.revive=Revive
ui.dbe.npc.enma_daioh.main.button.reincarnate=Reincarnate
ui.dbe.npc.enma_daioh.reincarnate.text=By reincarnating, you will lose your current body and all your stats. Do you want to continue?
ui.dbe.npc.enma_daioh.reincarnate.button.confirm=Yes
## goku
ui.dbe.npc.goku.title=Goku
ui.dbe.npc.goku.main.text.neutral=Hi, I'm Goku! I'm always ready for a good fight or to make new friends. What's going on? How can I help you today?
ui.dbe.npc.goku.main.text.good=Awesome! You look like someone who fights for justice. Let's get stronger together!
ui.dbe.npc.goku.main.text.evil=Hmm. I don't like your energy. But if you want to fight, I'll accept. Just don't disappoint me!
ui.dbe.npc.goku.main.text.master_1=Hello, apprentice! I'm glad to see someone willing to train to protect others. Keep working hard and you'll grow stronger every day.
ui.dbe.npc.goku.main.text.master_2=I can already see improvements after your first weight training. Your control and endurance are getting better with every battle.
ui.dbe.npc.goku.main.text.master_3=Your progress is impressive! You're starting to understand that true strength comes from discipline and never giving up.
ui.dbe.npc.goku.main.text.master_4=Hehe, now you're fighting like a true warrior! Your power has grown a lot since our first training session.
ui.dbe.npc.goku.main.text.master_5=I'm proud of how much you've improved, apprentice. Keep using your strength to protect the innocent and always push beyond your limits.
ui.dbe.npc.goku.main.text.master_bad_alignment=Your heart is filled with evil intentions... I cannot teach someone who uses power to cause suffering.
ui.dbe.npc.goku.main.button.weight=Weight
ui.dbe.npc.goku.main.button.skills=Skills
ui.dbe.npc.goku.weight.button.catch=Pick Up Weight
## kami sama
ui.dbe.npc.kami_sama.title=Kami-Sama
ui.dbe.npc.kami_sama.main.text.neutral=I'm glad to see you alive and vibrant! If you have questions or wish to learn something, feel free to ask. I'm here to teach you a few things.
ui.dbe.npc.kami_sama.main.text.good=I sense the light in your heart. It's always a pleasure to help a peacekeeper.
ui.dbe.npc.kami_sama.main.text.evil=I do not offer knowledge to those lost in darkness. Come back when you seek redemption.
ui.dbe.npc.kami_sama.main.button.cut_tail=Cut Tail
ui.dbe.npc.kami_sama.main.button.skills=Skills
ui.dbe.npc.kami_sama.cut_tail.text=By cutting the tail, a Saiyan loses the ability to transform into an Oozaru, but gains a 1.1x defense boost.
ui.dbe.npc.kami_sama.cut_tail.button.confirm=Cut
## king kai
ui.dbe.npc.king_kai.title=King Kai
ui.dbe.npc.king_kai.main.text.neutral=Ah, you've finally arrived! I've been waiting eagerly for you. I'm sure my techniques are unmatched!
ui.dbe.npc.king_kai.main.text.good=Ha! A pure heart and a sharp mind! Great! Let's learn some amazing techniques!
ui.dbe.npc.king_kai.main.text.evil=I don't teach sacred techniques to corrupted souls. Go reflect with King Enma!
ui.dbe.npc.king_kai.main.button.weight=Weight
ui.dbe.npc.king_kai.main.button.skills=Skills
ui.dbe.npc.king_kai.weight.button.catch=Pick Up Weight
## korin
ui.dbe.npc.korinMain.title=Master Korin
ui.dbe.npc.korin.main.text.neutral=Meow! What do you want?
ui.dbe.npc.korin.main.text.good=Meow! I'm always happy to help those on the right path. Strength and kindness must go together!
ui.dbe.npc.korin.main.text.evil=Hmph... Cats can smell bad intentions. I don't give Senzu Beans to those who stray from the path.
ui.dbe.npc.korin.main.text.fish=Meow... Where are the fish I asked for? On second thought, I can give you a Senzu Bean too! Besides the Flying Nimbus I promised, of course.
ui.dbe.npc.korin.main.button.senzu_bean=Senzu Bean
ui.dbe.npc.korin.main.button.flying_nimbus=Flying Nimbus
## krillin
ui.dbe.npc.krillin.title=Krillin
ui.dbe.npc.krillin.main.text.neutral=Hey! I'm Krillin... one of the Z Fighters! Heh, maybe not the strongest, but definitely the smartest. Need something?
ui.dbe.npc.krillin.main.text.good=Nice to see someone with a good heart! I can teach you a few moves if you want-just don't go too hard on me!
ui.dbe.npc.krillin.main.text.evil=Whoa, whoa... I've seen that look before, and it never ends well. If you're up to no good, don't think I'll just stand by!
ui.dbe.npc.krillin.main.button.skills=Skills
## master roshi
ui.dbe.npc.master_roshi.title=Master Roshi
ui.dbe.npc.master_roshi.main.text.neutral=Hohoho! So you've come to me in search of power, young grasshopper? Hmmm... Just know that strength doesn't come only from muscles, but from discipline and determination! If you wish to walk the path of great warriors, you'll have to train hard!
ui.dbe.npc.master_roshi.main.text.good=You have the eyes of determination... and a pure heart. I can teach you, but only if you have discipline!
ui.dbe.npc.master_roshi.main.text.evil=Hmph... I don't train scoundrels. Use that energy to reflect, not destroy!
ui.dbe.npc.master_roshi.main.button.weight=Weight
ui.dbe.npc.master_roshi.main.button.skills=Skills
ui.dbe.npc.master_roshi.weight.button.catch=Pick Up Weight
## merchant
ui.dbe.npc.merchant.title=Merchant
ui.dbe.npc.merchant.main.text.neutral=Ahhh, a traveler! I see EVERYTHING that passes through these lands... and you look like someone interesting. Perhaps a good deal is about to happen, hm?
ui.dbe.npc.merchant.main.text.good=Ho ho ho! That aura... it belongs to someone who pays properly! I like that! I have rare, shiny, and possibly magical items! Nothing cursed... probably.
ui.dbe.npc.merchant.main.text.evil=Heh... that look of yours tells me you buy things without asking where they came from. I like that too. But if you try to trick me, I DISAPPEAR. Literally.
ui.dbe.npc.merchant.main.button.clothing_shop=Clothes
## capsule corp engineer
ui.dbe.npc.capsule_corp_engineer.title=Capsule Corp Engineer
ui.dbe.npc.capsule_corp_engineer.main.text.neutral=Welcome to Capsule Corp! Don't touch anything blinking, and we'll get along fine. We're running tests on three new capsule models today.
ui.dbe.npc.capsule_corp_engineer.main.text.good=Oh, you're the one helping people out there! Bulma says our best inventions are made for people like you. Stay as long as you like, just mind the prototypes.
ui.dbe.npc.capsule_corp_engineer.main.text.evil=Security says to keep an eye on you. Please don't touch the equipment, or the capsules, or anything, really.
## mr popo
ui.dbe.npc.mr_popo.title=Mr. Popo
ui.dbe.npc.mr_popo.main.text.neutral=Hello. I am Mr. Popo. If you've come this far, it means you seek true training. Speak to me when you're ready.
ui.dbe.npc.mr_popo.main.text.good=With a pure heart, you can reach great heights. Follow me, with humility.
ui.dbe.npc.mr_popo.main.text.evil=You carry darkness... I cannot guide you in this state. Seek clarity before moving forward.
ui.dbe.npc.mr_popo.main.button.skills=Skills
## piccolo
ui.dbe.npc.piccolo.title=Piccolo
ui.dbe.npc.piccolo.main.text.neutral=Oh, you finally decided to seek my help? Not that I need recognition or anything, but, as always, I'm here to assist with any questions you may have.
ui.dbe.npc.piccolo.main.text.good=I see potential and a determined mind. Let's put that to the test.
ui.dbe.npc.piccolo.main.text.evil=Heh... I won't stop you from getting stronger. But if you cross my path, you'll regret it.
ui.dbe.npc.piccolo.main.button.weight=Weight
ui.dbe.npc.piccolo.main.button.skills=Skills
ui.dbe.npc.piccolo.weight.button.catch=Pick Up Cape
## unigame
ui.dbe.npc.unigame.title=Unigame
ui.dbe.npc.unigame.main.text.neutral=Hmmm... Another visitor on the island... I hope you have good manners. Master Roshi is always busy... but I see everything.
ui.dbe.npc.unigame.main.text.good=You have a kind heart... just like young Goku did. Stay on this path, with patience and wisdom.
ui.dbe.npc.unigame.main.text.evil=Hmph... I don't like your scent. If you're here to cause trouble... remember: even a turtle can bite.
## vegeta
ui.dbe.npc.vegeta.title=Vegeta
ui.dbe.npc.vegeta.main.text.neutral=Hmph. So you've come to me? I am Vegeta, the Prince of all Saiyans! I have no time for weaklings. If you want something, prove you deserve my attention.
ui.dbe.npc.vegeta.main.text.good=Hmph. I see determination in you. Do not mistake that for kindness. If you wish to grow stronger, then train until your body begs for rest!
ui.dbe.npc.vegeta.main.text.evil=Heh. That thirst for power... I recognize it. But do not think you can surpass me by taking the easy path. If you seek to dominate everything, you will have to defeat me first!
ui.dbe.npc.vegeta.main.button.skills=Skills
## whis
ui.dbe.npc.whis.title=Whis
ui.dbe.npc.whis.main.text.neutral=Hello! Lord Beerus is taking a celestial nap, and I, Whis, am here to savor Earth's delicacies. It would be my divine courtesy to assist you in any matter.
ui.dbe.npc.whis.main.text.good=Ah, a virtuous heart! Wonderful! I can share some tips... with a divine touch, of course.
ui.dbe.npc.whis.main.text.evil=You reek of malice... but I'm not one to judge. Let's see if you can learn with elegance.
ui.dbe.npc.whis.main.button.weight=Weight
ui.dbe.npc.whis.main.button.skills=Skills
ui.dbe.npc.whis.weight.button.catch=Pick Up Weight





