quest.saga_future_trunks_1.title=The Warning
quest.saga_future_trunks_1.text=Future Trunks returns badly wounded and brings terrifying news: a warrior called Goku Black is destroying his timeline and wiping out all of humanity. There is no time to lose. Go to Bulma and help repair the Time Machine to save the future.
quest.saga_future_trunks_2.title=Goku Black Appears
quest.saga_future_trunks_2.text=The impossible has happened... Goku Black has appeared in this timeline! His power is terrifying and his presence threatens the entire planet. Face him before he escapes to the future again.
quest.saga_future_trunks_3.title=Into the Future
quest.saga_future_trunks_3.text=The Time Machine has finally been repaired. Get in and travel to Trunks' devastated future. Help the survivors and fight alongside Trunks to end the chaos caused by Goku Black.

quest.saga_future_trunks_3.objective_1.task_1.dialog_1=""
quest.saga_future_trunks_3.objective_1.task_1.dialog_2=""
quest.saga_future_trunks_3.objective_1.task_1.dialog_3=""

quest.saga_future_trunks_3.objective_2.on_start.dialog_1=Goku Black: Humans are nothing but filth and must be eliminated.
quest.saga_future_trunks_3.objective_2.on_start.dialog_2=Goku Black: I can see far beyond you, warrior... above this world, above this universe...
quest.saga_future_trunks_3.objective_2.on_start.dialog_3=Goku Black: I watch from the place where all the truth about creation comes from... that is how I concluded that humans must become extinct.
quest.saga_future_trunks_3.objective_2.on_start.dialog_4=Goku Black: The one mistake among all of the gods' creations... is humanity. To turn the world, the universe and even this planet into a far more beautiful paradise...
quest.saga_future_trunks_3.objective_2.on_start.dialog_5=Goku Black: I will eliminate the humans!

quest.saga_future_trunks_4.title=Another Zamasu
quest.saga_future_trunks_4.text=The situation has gotten worse. A second Zamasu from another timeline has joined Goku Black. Together they are carrying out the "Zero Mortals Plan", a cruel scheme to exterminate all of humanity and create a universe without mortals.
quest.saga_future_trunks_5.title=The Fusion
quest.saga_future_trunks_5.text=Using the Potara Earrings, Goku Black and Zamasu have fused, giving rise to the terrifying Fused Zamasu. His power surpasses everything faced so far. Defeat this fusion before the entire universe is destroyed.
quest.saga_future_trunks_6.title=Corrupted
quest.saga_future_trunks_6.text=Even after taking severe damage, Fused Zamasu keeps evolving thanks to his immortal body. His form begins to warp and decay, spreading destructive energy everywhere. Now transformed into Corrupted Fused Zamasu, he has completely lost control and threatens to consume all of reality.
